tle":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[22,11,68,69,65,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[22,11,68,69,65,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[22,11,68,69,65,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"21000","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1029","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[22,11,68,69,65,70],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1007402","armor":"WP1016105","helmet":"WP1027305"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"东汉太尉杨震少子，一说为北宋“杨家将”先祖。杨震蒙冤身死之后，顺帝即位，杨家得以平反。杨奉承家学，仕至城门校尉。一生不居三公，远离朝堂最核心漩涡，保全家族血脉。汉末大乱，杨氏主支杨彪身陷乱世，杨奉一支守居华阴，传子杨敷。","tc":"東漢太尉楊震少子，一說為北宋“楊家將”先祖。楊震蒙冤身死之后，順帝即位，楊家得以平反。楊奉承家學，仕至城門校尉。一生不居三公，遠離朝堂最核心漩渦，保全家族血脈。漢末大亂，楊氏主支楊彪身陷亂世，楊奉一支守居華陰，傳子楊敷。","en":"The youngest son of Yang Zhen, Chief Officer of the Eastern Han, and according to some traditions, the ancestor of the Northern Song's famed ‘Yang Family Retainers’. After Yang Zhen died from false accusations, Emperor Shun ascended the throne, and the Yang family was exonerated. Yang Feng carried on his family's learning and rose in office to Colonel of the City Gates. Throughout his life, he never held the Three Excellencies, staying far from the central maelstrom of the imperial court to preserve his family's lineage. During the turmoil at the end of the Han dynasty, while Yang Biao of the main Yang branch was entangled in the chaotic era, Yang Feng's branch remained settled in Huayin, passing down to his son Yang Fu.","jp":"後漢の太尉・楊震の末子。一説には北宋の「楊家将」の先祖ともいわれる。楊震が無実の罪で命を落とした後、順帝が即位すると楊家の名誉は回復された。楊奉は家学を継ぎ、官位は城門校尉にまで至った。生涯を通じて三公の座には就かず、朝廷の中枢たる渦中から身を遠ざけることで家族の血脈を守り抜いた。漢末の動乱期、楊氏の嫡流である楊彪が乱世に巻き込まれる中、楊奉の家系は華陰にとどまり守り続け、その血脈は子の楊敷へと受け継がれた。","kr":"동한의 태위 양진의 막내아들이며, 일설에는 북송 '양씨 가문 무장'의 선조라고도 한다. 양진이 누명을 쓰고 목숨을 잃은 뒤 순제가 즉위하면서 양씨 가문은 신원되었다. 양봉은 가학을 계승하여 관직이 성문교위에 이르렀다. 평생 삼공의 자리에 오르지 않고 조정 핵심의 소용돌이를 멀리하여 가문의 혈통을 보전하였다. 한나라 말의 대란 속에서 양씨 본가의 양표가 난세에 휘말렸을 때도 양봉 계통은 화음에 머무르며 가계를 지켜냈고, 아들 양부에게 대를 이었다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ1042315","remark":"","surname":"杨","surnameTc":"楊","surnameEn":"Yang","surnameJp":"楊","surnameKr":"양","surnameOther":"","name":"奉","nameTc":"奉","nameEn":"Feng","nameJp":"奉","nameKr":"봉","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"杨奉2","power":"","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"0","city":"CS1028","gender":"0","rule":"22","force":"11","wise":"68","politics":"69","charm":"65","will":"70","ruleTalent":"2","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"9","politicsTalent":"9","charmTalent":"9","willTalent":"8","weaponMaster":"12/32/33/21/32/68/64/25","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"1001901;1006305